  their medical testing services - that  increases to 249 dollars they're going  to start to doubt that these services  are worth their investment indeed  23andme is now announcing sales have  declined the company is laying off staff  and scaling back its clinical studies  division a surprising turn in the  unpredictable world of DNA collection  the rise in popularity over the last few  years Ross Lord global news and that is  global national for this Sunday I'm  Robin Gill tonight your Canada is gone  to the point in New Brunswick thank you  for watching  Donna freeze and we'll be here tomorrow  have a great night  [Music]  you
 

